From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 15:56:38 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 50/54] POC-16a: BN6 camera shake and hit-stop on big hits

- Screen shake as BN6's camera_initShakeEffect / camera_doShakeEffect (asm/asm03_0.s:20653-20751,
  byte_8030284 levels +-1/2/4/8 px): super-effective/crit L1, KO and broken panels L2 20f,
  MegaChips and boss phases L2 30f, PAs and GigaChips L3 30f (TUNE). The HUD stays put.
- Hit-stop (our addition, TUNE): 3-8 frames on super-effective, crit, counter, PA/Giga hits and
  KOs; buttons pressed during it are delivered after. PKBN_NO_HITSTOP=1 turns it off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
